2 NOTE My grandfather Knut Skjærven. I was named after him and not the other way around, but I guess you got that. Right? Shall we say he was in his thirties here?
1 OBJE
2 FILE https://media.geni.com/37/f9/a6/1c/3738160/tej22cew/37f9a61c265ef1d_large.jpg?hash=fc5edaf9885344ee06060f8528953031ee047b3a0baef60ca2b7833916dd03eb.1794643199
