2 FORM jpg
2 NOTE This is from left to right Knut Skjærven (me), Randi Skjærven (sister), Tove, our Danish nurse and Rolf Skjærven (brother). Shot at the farm Skjærven at Saghaug, Voss, Norway. We went there for summer holidays. By best guess is th
3 CONC at this is 1954 and Randi would be 1 year old, approx.
1 OBJE
2 FILE https://media.geni.com/37/ea/bc/5b/3738160/qex84yaf/37eabc5b69d66d9_large.jpg?hash=6ffd3981a34b459f57ed3641529623367ca7bd66163af7b3e69ea8556cbee2f7.1794643199
2 FORM jpg
2 NOTE This is indeed one of my favourites. Knut Skjærven and Knut Skjærven shot not far from the farmhouse at  Skjærven, Evanger, Voss, Norway. This is probably shot 1951 of 1952. Summertime. Photographer is Johannes Skjærven.
1 OBJE
2 FILE https://media.geni.com/37/ea/ce/0b/3738160/jur76riz/37eace0bc3b9f36_large.jpg?hash=ad811c51d9ba8117f4cd65a7be017bc636f3930c14dfd9ef29176512db7cc6d6.1794643199
2 FORM jpg
2 NOTE And of course Anna Skjærven was my grandmother. How could I forget.
2 NOTE Beautiful couple: Anna and Knut Skjærven in the early years. I was named after this gentleman. He is my grandfather.
1 OBJE
2 FILE https://media.geni.com/37/fa/1f/f7/3738160/fap87qup/37fa1ff79e7c7ba_large.jpg?hash=33ac7e825b704f73dfa0bb66f01614d326835656576b4f6adb1428b8afa51880.1794643199
