1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.hansonrunsvold.com/obituaries/Bradley-Selberg/
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary for Bradley Ernest Selberg Bradley Selberg, 58, passed away on Good Friday, April 18, 2014 at Sanford Palliative Care. He was born in Fargo on June 10, 1955 to Ernest and Irene (Hjornevick) Selberg. Bradley graduated from
2 CONC  Fargo Special Education at South High and lived in Wahpeton the past several years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bradley enjoyed watching wrestling, boxing, quiz shows and ball games on television. He also participated in the Special Olympics.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bradley is survived by his mother, Irene Selberg, and a sister, Brenda (Dale) Palo, Arlington, Washington, and a brother, Dean, Fargo, ND. He was preceded in death by his father, Ernest, and brother, Keith.
